title: Built agent-purchase server path + merchant MCP (Option A, mocked)
summary: 'Implemented the agent-initiated purchase flow end to end with a mock personhood verifier (Option A). Server: agent grants (JWT aud=agent), POST /agent/checkout (initiate, no charge) -> verification session -> GET /verify/:sessionId (mock World ID Selfie Check) -> settle -> GET /agent/purchase/:orderId (poll). Shared #orders-service + #payment-service (PAYMENTS_MODE=mock default) across the human and agent legs; fixed the Express async-throw hang. Built the merchant MCP (mcp/, @agentic-commerce/merchant-mcp) and a storefront Agent access panel. All layers verified.'
