body: 'Option A handoff: agent initiates -> server returns verification_required + a /verify/:sessionId URL -> human completes the (mocked) World ID Selfie Check -> order settles -> agent polls to ''completed''. Real World ID swaps in at #verification-service.markSessionVerified (called only after a verified proof) and #verify-route (IDKit widget instead of the mock GET). MCP is mcp/ (@agentic-commerce/merchant-mcp), our-store-only, npm-publishable later; tools: list_products, initiate_purchase, check_purchase_status. Next: open PR from feat/storefront-and-auth and merge. Later polish: real World ID integration, Chrome-extension surface, MCP generalization to any compliant storefront, storefront/UX polish.'
